    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom end of terrace home offering stylish and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nAs you enter this impressive home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hall that leads to a bright and inviting living room, complete with a feature fireplace, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The modern kitchen and dining area, upgraded by the current owner, is located to the rear and offers direct access to the spacious rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and family activities. Upstairs, the property features three well-proportioned bedrooms (including primary with an en suite) along with a contemporary main bathroom.\r\n\r\nLucan is a highly sought after truly beautiful picturesque village sitting on the banks of the River Liffey and rich in history. The village exudes charm and offers a wide variety of shops, restaurants, pubs, and other services. Both the popular Liffey Valley & Ballyowen Shopping Centres are nearby. This property also boasts efficient transportation links to Dublin City Centre. There is an excellent bus service including nite link. There is also convenient access to the N4, M4, and M50 motorways ensuring connectivity.\r\n \r\nViewing comes highly recommended to appreciate this fine home.\r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:*** *All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
